       "She's checking the permits."
      ],
      [
       "Question",
       "What are you doing?"
      ]
     ],
     "paras": [
      "For what is happening <b>now</b>, at this moment: <b>am / is / are</b> + verb<b>-ing</b>.",
      "Short answers on deck are fine: <i>Chipping.</i> <i>Lashing the drums.</i>"
     ],
     "avoid": "I chipping. · I am chip. · What you are doing?"
